#### Testing Strategy

**Unit Testing** (Backend - PTN-APP-EXT-011):

- Test workflow state transitions (valid and invalid transitions)
- Test workflow state persistence and recovery
- Test workflow compensation logic (rollback on errors)
- Test workflow activities in isolation
- Mock all external dependencies

**Unit Testing** (Frontend - PTN-APP-EXT-012):

- Test wizard step components render correctly
- Test wizard navigation (forward, backward, skip steps)
- Test form validation (client-side)
- Test wizard state management
- Mock workflow API calls

**Integration Testing**:

- Test frontend wizard triggers correct backend workflow transitions
- Test workflow state synchronization with wizard UI
- Test user navigates away and returns (workflow state persisted)
- Test concurrent users in same workflow (isolation)

**E2E Testing**:

```typescript
describe('Eligibility Determination Workflow', () => {
  it('should complete full workflow successfully', () => {
    cy.visit('/eligibility/new');

    // Step 1: Applicant Info
    cy.get('[name="firstName"]').type('John');
    cy.get('[name="lastName"]').type('Doe');
    cy.get('[name="ssn"]').type('123-45-6789');
    cy.get('button[type="submit"]').click();

    // Step 2: Identity Verification
    cy.contains('Identity Verification').should('be.visible');
    cy.get('[name="verificationCode"]').type('ABC123');
    cy.get('button[type="submit"]').click();

    // Step 3: Eligibility Questions
    cy.contains('Eligibility Questions').should('be.visible');
    cy.get('[name="income"]').type('25000');
    cy.get('[name="householdSize"]').type('3');
    cy.get('button[type="submit"]').click();

    // Step 4: Review & Submit
    cy.contains('Review & Submit').should('be.visible');
    cy.contains('John Doe').should('be.visible');
    cy.get('button[type="submit"]').click();

    // Verify completion
    cy.contains('Application Submitted Successfully').should('be.visible');
  });

  it('should persist workflow state across sessions', () => {
    // Start workflow
    cy.visit('/elegibility/new');
    cy.get('[name="firstName"]').type('Jane');
    cy.get('button[type="submit"]').click();

    // Get workflow ID from URL
    cy.url().then(url => {
