#### Registration Order Dependencies

When using **PTN-APP-EXT-014 (Extension Point Registration)**, register in this order:

1. **Configuration**: PTN-APP-EXT-005 (Extension Config) - Load configuration first
2. **Services**: PTN-APP-EXT-001 (Plugins) - Register DI services
3. **Data**: PTN-APP-EXT-007 (EF Extensions) - Register DbContext extensions
4. **Business Logic**: PTN-APP-EXT-010 (Rule Engine), PTN-APP-EXT-011 (Workflow) - Register rules/workflows
5. **UI**: PTN-APP-EXT-012 (Components), PTN-APP-EXT-014 (Extension Points) - Register UI extensions last

**Example Registration Code:**

```csharp
public class ExtensionBootstrapper
{
    public void Register(IServiceCollection services, IConfiguration config)
    {
        // 1. Configuration
        services.Configure<TexasExtensionSettings>(config.GetSection("Texas"));

        // 2. Services (Plugins)
        services.AddScoped<ITexasProviderRepository, TexasProviderRepository>();
        services.AddScoped<ITexasRuleProvider, TexasRuleProvider>();

        // 3. Data (EF Extensions)
        services.AddDbContext<CustomDbContext>();

        // 4. Business Logic
        services.AddScoped<IRuleEngine, TexasClaimsRuleEngine>();
        services.AddScoped<IWorkflowEngine, EligibilityWorkflowEngine>();

        // 5. UI (Extension Points)
        var extensionRegistry = services.GetRequiredService<IExtensionRegistry>();
        extensionRegistry.RegisterWidget("texas-claims-widget", typeof(TexasClaimsWidget));
    }
}
```

